# arm: massive
# 20% verbatim; rewrite freely, keep the thinking and the voice
# created 2026-08-13. Deltas from the base; everything unlisted falls through.
#
# Runs every day beside the base, into sync/Obsidian/Posts/massive/.
# bin/arm.sh promote massive folds these into profiles/base.env.

# Its own copy of the curator prompt. This is the arm that most needed one: the
# base prompt's premise is "assemble, never write", stated in six separate
# places, and a directive announcing that the rule was lifted left all six
# standing. The overlay rewrites them, and frees the directive slot so this arm
# inherits the base's propose-generously.md.
PROMPTS_DIR=$BLOG_REPO_DIR/profiles/overlays/massive
VERBATIM_MIN=20
NEW_SLACK_EVERY=1
GLUE_MAX_WORDS=40
GATE_TRACE=1
# quotas deliberately absent: inherited from the base, so the only thing
# this arm changes is how it writes.
